            {
                "entry_id": "314ad45c-49f2-36f9-b79d-254001483bbe",
                "word": "portage",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "fbda1ae9-5e60-4228-88fb-e282ffe49ab4",
                        "entry_id": "314ad45c-49f2-36f9-b79d-254001483bbe",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "portages"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6e4d510e-ec6b-3530-a358-4d29c7fc2913",
                        "entry_id": "314ad45c-49f2-36f9-b79d-254001483bbe",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An act of carrying, especially the carrying of a boat overland between two waterways."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b9a972ea-bdfe-387d-bd7a-a8ffb3969329",
                        "entry_id": "314ad45c-49f2-36f9-b79d-254001483bbe",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The route used for such carrying."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "964bd01c-a52e-3e3c-b80c-4bd9255426f6",
                        "entry_id": "314ad45c-49f2-36f9-b79d-254001483bbe",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A charge made for carrying something."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4470c525-73a3-407a-b06e-c0e00c40819b",
                                "sense_id": "964bd01c-a52e-3e3c-b80c-4bd9255426f6",
                                "text": "gaining thereby the charge of portage; was a great benefit to them"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c29ebc4a-9688-3b23-9565-b2a35356e745",
                        "entry_id": "314ad45c-49f2-36f9-b79d-254001483bbe",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Carrying capacity; tonnage."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9cf59b4d-0258-404b-8b69-6eadc44d821f",
                                "sense_id": "c29ebc4a-9688-3b23-9565-b2a35356e745",
                                "text": "Onely the shippe that came thither payde a small thing according to her portage, aud euery yeere in the port of Orisa were laden fiue and twentie or thirtie ships great and smal with ryce and diuers sortes of fine white bumbaste cloth[…]"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "095316d2-554b-3d26-b53c-2bb66a09410d",
                        "entry_id": "314ad45c-49f2-36f9-b79d-254001483bbe",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The wages paid to a sailor when in port, or for a voyage."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9b7fa221-8fab-39d0-87f9-51789483e943",
                        "entry_id": "314ad45c-49f2-36f9-b79d-254001483bbe",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A porthole."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1105d095-69bd-43fc-9f44-38880cd24864",
                                "sense_id": "9b7fa221-8fab-39d0-87f9-51789483e943",
                                "text": "Then lend the eye a terrible aspect;\nLet pry through the portage of the head\nLike the brass cannon; let the brow o'erwhelm it\nAs fearfully as doth a galled rock\nO'erhang and jutty his confounded base,\nSwill'd with the wild and wasteful ocean."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a71e065c-e234-4229-906f-145b73754439",
                        "source_entry_id": "314ad45c-49f2-36f9-b79d-254001483bbe",
                        "source_sense_description": "route used for portage",
                        "target_lang_word": "Portage",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Portage",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b9d39ac4-2750-37f2-9124-0b132942035e",
                                        "entry_id": "73908899-f5e4-3b0e-b6f5-843b1ce9a3c5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Stelle an einem Gewässer (meist ein Fluss), an der das Wasserfahrzeug über Land transportiert werden muss"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1426950c-2a34-4c32-b84a-14b5c4bbfb37",
                                                "sense_id": "b9d39ac4-2750-37f2-9124-0b132942035e",
                                                "text": "„Bei Morgendämmerung brachen wir auf; da auf der Portage ein Feuer gewütet hatte und die ganze Gegend verwüstet war, kamen wir nur sehr langsam und mühsam vorwärts und erreichten erst um vier Uhr nachmittags wieder den Fluß.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ee2816e8-ecb4-399a-9029-4abba209cc33",
                                        "entry_id": "73908899-f5e4-3b0e-b6f5-843b1ce9a3c5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ladung eines Schiffes"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "14e00adc-3e7e-3402-8f51-d1411f6afeaa",
                                        "entry_id": "73908899-f5e4-3b0e-b6f5-843b1ce9a3c5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Gepäck der zu einem Schiff gehörenden Seeleute, mit dem sie auch eigenständig handeln dürfen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"3\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
